{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21974","headline":"丘中有一士二首 二 · 白居易","name":"丘中有一士二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丘中有一士，守道岁月深。\n行披带索衣，坐拍无弦琴。\n不饮浊泉水，不息曲木阴。\n所逢苟非义，粪土千黄金。\n乡人化其风，熏如兰在林。\n智愚与强弱，不忍相欺侵。\n我欲访其人，将行复沈吟。\n何必见其面，但在学其心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}